---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import AlbumCard from '../../components/AlbumCard.astro';
import {getContent} from '../../lib/content';
const {albums}=await getContent();
---
<Base title="光影存档"><div class="container page"><SectionHeading title="光影存档" english="PHOTO ARCHIVE" page/><section class="archive-introduction" aria-label="关于光影存档">
 <div class="archive-introduction-copy">
  <p>这里是一座按地理坐标生长的私人影像档案。每一次出发，我都试图用快门在流动的时间里截下几个切面——有时是破晓时分刺破云层的金光，有时是异乡街头擦肩而过的微风。</p>
  <p>每一座城市都被封存为一册独立的影集。往里走，除了定格的画面，那些令我驻足良久的瞬间，都被写在了相纸的背面。</p>
 </div>
 <aside class="archive-reading-note" aria-label="翻阅提示"><span class="archive-note-star" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p><span class="archive-note-title">翻阅提示：</span>按地点点击进入对应影集。影集中带有印记的照片附有拍摄手记，<strong>点开单张照片即可阅读当时的故事</strong>。</p></aside>
 </section><div class="album-grid">{albums.map(album=><AlbumCard album={album}/>)}</div>{!albums.length&&<p>光影存档正在整理中。</p>}</div></Base>

<style>
 .archive-introduction{max-width:820px;margin:0 0 64px}
 .archive-introduction-copy{font-family:var(--serif-zh);font-size:18px;line-height:2.1;letter-spacing:.035em;color:var(--muted)}
 .archive-introduction-copy p{margin:0 0 20px}
 .archive-reading-note{font-family:var(--serif-zh);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:22px;margin-top:30px;font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted)}
 .archive-reading-note p{margin:0}.archive-note-star{color:#91754f;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4}.archive-note-title{color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.08em}.archive-reading-note strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}
 @media(max-width:600px){.archive-introduction{margin-bottom:40px}.archive-introduction-copy{font-size:17px;line-height:2.1;letter-spacing:.02em}.archive-reading-note{gap:10px;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px;font-size:15px}}
</style>
